// @ens-test
// @exit 2
// @stderr-contains the test program stopped with code 0 while running 'first test exits'. Run that test alone with 'ens test --filter "first test exits"' to see its output
// A test program that ends with 0 before every result is in has not passed: the failing test after
// the one that ended the run never ran, so the command reports the stop and names the test.
